I offer private harp tuition for students of all levels, focusing on technique, musicality, and confidence.
Lessons are tailored to each student's individual goals – whether that means progressing through graded examinations, preparing for a school music scholarship or audition, or learning for enjoyment.
My teaching draws on formal training from the Guildhall School of Music combined with years of professional performance experience. I place equal value on strong technique and comprehensive musicianship training, weaving sight-reading, musical theory, and aural skills into every lesson to build well-rounded musicians. 
While my own training has classical foundations, I encourage students to explore a broad repertoire, from traditional harp pieces to jazz and contemporary works, so that technical progress is matched alongside a growing curiosity for the instrument.
